committer konrad-metric <konrad@metric.xyz> 1781567693 +0200

Rename pool hooks to extensions across metric-periphery for metric-core alignment.

Important changes:
   - hooks to extensions directories - moved contracts/hooks and interfaces/hooks to extensions paths
   - product contract renames - DepositAllowlistHook, SwapAllowlistHook, PriceVelocityGuardHook, OracleValueStopLossHook and matching interfaces renamed to Extension suffix
   - BaseMetricExtension consolidation - inlined FACTORY, onlyFactory, onlyPoolAdmin, and related errors from removed SubhookUtils; HookNotImplemented renamed to ExtensionNotImplemented
   - periphery API rename - hookData and hookDatas to extensionData and extensionDatas in router, swapper, liquidity adder, and quoter interfaces and implementations
   - test suite rename - hook tests moved to test/extensions with updated contract names, imports, and variables

Small changes:
    - README terminology updated to IMetricOmmExtensions and extensionOrders; MockHookPool to MockExtensionPool; quoter and NatSpec comment wording; extension tests assert BaseMetricExtension.OnlyPoolAdmin; forge fmt on swapper, quoter, liquidity adder, and OracleValueStopLossSubExtension test
